    "detailed_description": "<h1>Help Shape The Game - Join Us On Discord!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Stunt track builder is a physic-simulation game about building giant stunt tracks in your home and collecting all the super looking toy cars. Build the stunt track of your dream, all in VR.<br><br>Features:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841260/extras/394e68f587efc6aa92e4c873fef6a78f.avif?t=1695113993\" /></div><br><br>+ Stunt track buildings, including turn, slope, curve, loop and wall riding (for cars).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841260/extras/2a29d75c0461d8b6105623dd6f9b84a0.avif?t=1695113993\" /></div><br><br>+ Toy-car physics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841260/extras/943e5123a689d6fa83a02b68129e6b1f.avif?t=1695113993\" /></div><br><br>+ Cars and tracks collection.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841260/extras/f1e651e85c1d404a5597dc7adf9da89d.avif?t=1695113993\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Stunt track builder is a physic-simulation game about building giant stunt tracks in your home and collecting all the super looking toy cars. Build the stunt track of your dream, all in VR.<br><br>Features:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841260/extras/394e68f587efc6aa92e4c873fef6a78f.avif?t=1695113993\" /></div><br><br>+ Stunt track buildings, including turn, slope, curve, loop and wall riding (for cars).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841260/extras/2a29d75c0461d8b6105623dd6f9b84a0.avif?t=1695113993\" /></div><br><br>+ Toy-car physics.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841260/extras/943e5123a689d6fa83a02b68129e6b1f.avif?t=1695113993\" /></div><br><br>+ Cars and tracks collection.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841260/extras/f1e651e85c1d404a5597dc7adf9da89d.avif?t=1695113993\" /></div>",
